      "side": 1,
      "message": "Dear TJ Mercier:\n    We already have your fix(https://android-review.googlesource.com/c/kernel/common/+/2112350) in our code, but there is still dma-buf-sys waiting for the rwsem lock problem for a long time, and the current process has been spinning there and will not go to sleep. The spin time there is even more than 4 seconds.",
